# [UFMRG](../wg/ufmrg.html)

## Summary

The User-Facing Formal Methods Research Group (UFMRG) met at IETF 127. The session focused primarily on formal analysis of DNS and DNSSEC across zone configurations, recursive resolvers, and client implementations (web browsers), followed by a brief presentation on formal security analysis of early attestation protocols in TLS.

